rength their period of service is  approximately 5 years  upon recruitment to the sat the  officer's name is made classified from  the roster of active police officers  this is to protect them from being  attacked by criminals extremists  and terrorist groups after the  reactivation of team rainbow in 2015  two sat operators were recruited to  bring their skills and expertise  to assist in the fight against terrorism  on a global scale  these operators were named hibana and  [Music]  echo  [Music]  yumiko iwagawa codenamed hibana  is an attacking operator in team rainbow  born and raised in nagoya the fourth  largest city in japan  while her mother stayed at home raising  her and her sister her father worked as  a butcher  being a proud and diligent housewife  hibana's mother wouldn't allow him  inside the house until he'd been hosed  down in the garden  by her children drenched in frigid water  and dancing barefoot  is a fond memory hibana often recounts  with her friends  from an early age she was encouraged by  appearance to engage in  kaiodo the japanese martial art of  archery  or the way of the bow within her this is  instilled  a groundness and innocence serenity as  in modern day practice  it encompasses the spiritual discipline  of meditation  when practicing the art of hyudo the  goal is not to hit the target  but to open one's heart and spirit to  the technique  as when all is in balance the arrow will  reach the destination  along with kyudo she became an adept and  skilled martial artist  and at the age of 18 joined the national  police academy  there she further developed her tactical  versatility and because of her strong  vivacious and witty style of leadership  along with the unique explosive devices  she earned the nickname  hibana which means spark  she was later recruited by the aichi  police department special assault team  where she flourished and quickly  ascended the ranks due to her charisma  and various techniques she acquired  further adaptability in a various  training  including proficiency and performing  assaults in tubular spaces such as buses  trains and airplanes  a unique and well-traveled individual  she speaks seven languages fluently  and her other specialization includes  being adept at counter gorilla  over warfare time with the sat she has  trained with a number of different units  including the fbi swat and gogn  her expertise in gaining entry to  high-risk areas and on-rush tactics  is legendary she is the sort of  individual who inspires others  even went from vastly different  backgrounds to herself  the ease at which other operators find  themselves in makes her an exceptional  asset  in a magnitude of situations yet she  remains gracious and kind  never letting the other's admiration of  her to get to her head  hibana has a solid working relationship  with thermite who is like a mentor to  her  and beside their professional  collaborations they are also  most notably very good friends  a secret or maybe not so secretive  relationship seems to exist between her  and pulse there are a number of  indications  that this relationship may be serious  including pulse's invitational charm  titled pulse's heart which features the  japanese name  yumiko inscribed on it which of course  is first name  also there is a photo of the two of them  on fortress and she appears to be  wearing his charm  as a necklace pulse has furthermore  become obsessed with working on being  more in the moment  slowing time and striving to be more  mindful of others  he is also valiantly attempting to learn  japanese in order to impress habana  which has meant he's been hanging around  operator echo a lot  much to ekko's annoyance  specialist dokkaebi and habana who often  spend a lot of time together in the lab  seem to have a rather tense relationship  while it's not crystal clear where this  tension comes from  it may have something to do with their  vastly different personalities  hibana may envy dokkaebi's easy  self-assurance  just as she did her younger sister her  younger sibling who always appeared to  have immense confidence  in everything that she would say and do  and she was constantly displaying  sureness  in her own abilities and likewise  dokkaebi exhibits the same confidence  she has always broken others  expectations of her she excels in  everything she has ever put in mind to  and although there is times she is  buttered headed with the superiors  she knows how to play the game and she  plays it well  whereas hibana has always had a sense of  grace calm sensibility  and is universally respected by her  peers  but deep down there lies an unsureness  about herself  [Music]  she has worked hard on her tranquility  focused on her inner quietness  and put forward a stoic persona to  others  so therefore it should come as no  surprise that at times hibana can become  notably impatient  with dokabi who is playful clever  serious and reckless  not that she appears to notice or even  care  while attending a special operations  conference in jordan  hibano met thurmite a pioneer in  brimstone bc3  exothermic experiments she collaborated  with them to develop the x  kairos a 40 millimeter grenade launcher  this weapon is capable of firing  explosive pellets that can be detonated  simultaneously from a distance  masaru inatsu codenamed ekko  is a defending operator in team rainbow  on the outer borders of tokyo lies the  city tsujinami  the hometown of ekko  although he is an only child and has  never had to compete for his parents  affections with siblings  he has never been close to them even  when he was a small boy  if there is one lesson in particular  that he has learned from his parents  it is that is a sign of weakness to  switch off and he has been conditioned  to believe that a restful mind  indicates a lack of intelligence  his parents have always been somewhat  aloof and he is often joked that a  calculator has more emotional range than  they do  as a result he learned from a very young  age to be self-sufficient  and became accustomed to working on his  own  over time this has made him very  resistant to working with others  as he lacked many of the skills and how  to effectively communicate  and it's of no surprise really as it's  all he's ever known  so he thought that he didn't need anyone  else and his role models only further  solidified these ideas  therefore it's easy to see why he could  absolutely lose himself  in the world of robotics people in their  emotions confuse him  whereas robotics is a deeply fascinating  subject in which he could put all of his  energy and time into without the need of  human to human communication  it requires time to learn such a  specialized skill dedication  and the understanding of the bigger  picture and how to achieve the desired  product  so for ekko robotics was the perfect fit  he could carry out his work in solitude  and didn't have to rely on the  companionship  or input of others  over time he learned how to construct  and program his own robotics and drones  and began competing in numerous  competitions in which often  he won at tokyo metropolitan university  he studied electrical and electronic  engineering which focused on the  development of new technologies  while addressing the issues of  sustainable development and the  importance of reducing environmental  impacts  not long after graduating he joined the  research and development laboratory at  the national agency security bureau  and there he began inventing specific  tech that would aid them in the field  he was trained in anti-terrorism and  intelligence gathering  and also began designing specific tech  that would better aid the bureau  joint training experience after the  nagoya hostage crisis  prompted ekko to transfer to the ikea  police department special unit  whereas a relentless focus enabled him  to find creative solutions and  alternative strategies  eventually he returned to tokyo where  his exceptional mind  and intel gathering techniques had  caught the attention of rainbow  he works alongside fellow operator  hibana for the sat  and over time he is learning to work in  a group with a number of operators  that is both friendly and is a mutually  beneficial dynamic for everyone  however he still gets frustrated easily  by others and struggles to communicate  his ideas or intentions  which at times can lead to high tension  and misunderstandings  nonetheless it does seem to have  developed mutual understanding with  specialist kevira  as they are both direct and outspoken  individuals who believe that those who  are offended by them  simply don't get the joke an example is  when he was discussing the advice given  to him by specialist alibi  he confessed that he thought albert's  suggestions were pretty smart for  someone without an engineering degree  other operators he's worked closely with  includes durkerby  who he has worked with on a number of  projects  while they're on friendly terms they can  become quite competitive  especially when trying to outdo each  other in the workshop  in 2005 he collaborated with the hong  kong special duties unit  where he met specialist yin where the  two became romantically involved  before breaking up a year later while it  said that their relationship didn't  progress further  it should come with no surprise as he  has few outside interests other than  robotics  and consequently only thinks about  improving his own operational efficiency  ying on the other hand is easygoing  blends well with others  takes enjoyment in working with the team  and has an effective way of making  people feel comfortable  and secure  echo's tactics have often been described  as tricky and unpredictable  he is always active and never seems to  shut off  this can make it hard to relate to  others as he doesn't recognize the  importance of downtime  and that everyone needs diversions  especially those in high stress jobs  known as disputing his intelligence or  his skill he is clearly an incredibly  valuable team member  while his biggest struggle may be  relating to others his desire  to explore the ai of his fellow  operators by pushing their buttons  is something that may be useful in  teaching him the social skills that he  so surely needs  for the future furthermore as much as he  may not realize it  and may even try to hide it he needs  these people  and he needs team rainbow there is  family  [Music]  in an attempt to overcome the  limitations of ranged weapons  ekko developed a drone called yukai  equipped with an acoustic hailing device  the drain releases disorientating sonic  bursts within a given perimeter  on top of this it transmits a video feed  back to echo allowing him to keep his  immediate location  secure  these are certainly slow burners these  videos but i've had quite a few of you  asking me to continue with the series  which is cool because i really enjoy  reading up on these guys  obviously based on the views there are  more popular groups out there  like the sas and spesners generally the  larger more well-known groups  but which individual operator stories  have you liked so far  let me know in the comments otherwise  thank you very much for watching and  i'll catch you in the next one  cheers  you

